#N canvas 0 0 700 520 10;
#X text 20 20 delay_fx~.pd -- feedback delay effect (1:1 mlrv recreation \, gap analysis item 1 \, corresponds to +DELAY.maxpat). receive~ fxout in (mixer's per-voice wet send \, bus-based) \, real outlet~ out (wet signal -- the parent sums every effect's outlet~ before the one real send~ fxin \, see this builder script's docstring for why a second bus-based send~ fxin doesn't generalize to multiple effects). Control inlet: \"time <ms>\" (1-2000 \, smoothed 50ms slide) \, \"feedback <0-1>\" (clipped 0-0.95 \, smoothed 20ms).;
#X obj 20 100 receive~ fxout;
#X obj 300 100 inlet;
#X obj 300 140 route time feedback;
#X obj 300 180 clip 1 2000;
#X obj 300 220 pack f 50;
#X obj 300 260 line~;
#X obj 460 180 clip 0 0.95;
#X obj 460 220 pack f 20;
#X obj 460 260 line~;
#X obj 20 260 +~;
#X obj 20 300 clip~ -0.98 0.98;
#X obj 20 340 delwrite~ mlrv-delaybuf 2000;
#X obj 300 300 delread4~ mlrv-delaybuf;
#X obj 300 340 hip~ 5;
#X obj 460 380 *~;
#X obj 300 420 outlet~;
#X connect 1 0 10 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 6 0 13 0;
#X connect 3 1 7 0;
#X connect 7 0 8 0;
#X connect 8 0 9 0;
#X connect 13 0 14 0;
#X connect 14 0 16 0;
#X connect 14 0 15 0;
#X connect 9 0 15 1;
#X connect 15 0 11 0;
#X connect 11 0 10 1;
#X connect 10 0 12 0;
